  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc03658fab27f8de",
      "translationZh": "将 Hugging Face 模型部署到生产环境意味着要做出十几项决策：为模型架构选择合适的推理服务容器，确认你的 AWS 区域当前使用的镜像标签，以及选择与模型内存占用相匹配的实例类型。除了基础设施，你还必须配置自动扩缩容，以免在空闲端点上浪费 GPU 小时。你还需要设置 Amazon CloudWatch 告警，在用户察觉之前发现静默故障。在你做出这些决策之后，Amazon SageMaker AI 就能将这些工作压缩到数小时内完成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad5f1838feb29c02",
      "translationZh": "这种结构化、可重复的工作，正是 Kiro 和 Claude Code 等编程智能体的设计用途。向编程智能体描述要部署的模型，然后离开，回来时就得到一个可用的端点——这种做法很诱人。但在实践中，缺乏指导的编程智能体可能做出错误决策，生成脆弱、成本高昂或悄然出错的端点。对于较新的模型，这个问题会更严重，因为它们的训练数据可能不包含最新的部署知识。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0071b1829d76d488",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，你将学习如何使用智能体技能，在 SageMaker AI 上部署可用于生产环境的 Hugging Face 模型。你从 Hugging Face Skills 安装六项技能，让编程智能体针对一个 Hugging Face 模型开展工作，然后获得一个实时端点，其中配有自动扩缩容、Amazon CloudWatch 告警、来自 AWS Deep Learning Containers (DLC) 目录的正确推理服务容器，以及经过验证的资源清理流程。实时端点是默认选项，但这些技能还支持可缩容至零的实时推理、无服务器推理、异步推理、批量转换和 Amazon Bedrock Custom Model Import。这些技能是开源的，仅使用 Python 和 AWS Command Line Interface (AWS CLI)，无需修改即可在 macOS、Linux 和 Windows 上运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b7b34601479d2b05",
      "translationZh": "缺乏指导的编程智能体存在的问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "deafe413b0613ef6",
      "translationZh": "要展示这些技能究竟能避免什么问题，观察一个能力出色的智能体在没有这些技能时会如何行动，很有帮助。针对以下请求，我们分别测试了 Kiro（使用 Auto 或 Claude Fable 5）和 Claude Code（使用 Opus 4.8）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8936f708c1d72b8a",
      "translationZh": "两个编程智能体最初都选择了 Text Generation Inference (TGI) 作为要部署的推理服务容器。这个选择可以理解，因为多年来 TGI 一直是默认选项，而且模型训练数据中充满了采用它的教程。但该区域可用的 TGI 构建版本早于 Qwen3 架构出现的时间，无法加载该模型。端点未能通过健康检查。智能体提升了 TGI 版本，重新部署，再次失败，然后转向 vLLM。这导致了多次部署失败，每次部署都会在启动后崩溃，而启动期间的 GPU 时间均会计费。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20b3706210ebeff0",
      "translationZh": "第二个请求的失败则更不易察觉。我们要求同一个智能体部署一个多模态混合专家（MoE）扩散模型，该模型在测试前仅几周才发布。编程智能体确认了它的存在，但又编写了一个基于 TGI 的脚本，而 TGI 是文本生成服务器，没有支持离散扩散图文模型的后端。没有任何明显的报错。只有当端点无法启动时，你才会发现问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b80aac6fb3b5053",
      "translationZh": "这两次运行有着相同的根本原因：缺少部署相关事实，而不是推理失败。智能体的规划和调试能力都很好。它缺少的是最新且具体的知识。近期的 Qwen 模型需要 vLLM。机器学习（ML）技术栈中的许多组件都没有适用于 Python 3.13 的可用 wheel 包。容器镜像应从已发布的 AWS Deep Learning Containers 目录中解析确定。这些知识的变化速度比模型权重的更新速度更快。因此，我们将其编写成可编辑的技能文件，而不是依赖最新发布的模型来吸收这些知识。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad2911cac575ec17",
      "translationZh": "表 1 比较了无指导的智能体与安装了技能的智能体所进行的模型部署。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ef9b43e8bb7afeb",
      "translationZh": "先用 TGI → 健康检查失败 → 改用 vLLM",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8891a896b62d89bd",
      "translationZh": "在创建任何资源之前就选定了 vLLM",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ac28744e270a0bc",
      "translationZh": "通过反复试错发现",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8154292ef603dfc2",
      "translationZh": "从 AWS DLC 目录中解析确定，并在注册表查询被拒绝时采用回退方案",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "663dd588826c8395",
      "translationZh": "目标跟踪，1–2 个实例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4936358315d510ed",
      "translationZh": "三个 CloudWatch 告警（延迟、错误、开销）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29d98ea93d3dab3d",
      "translationZh": "README 推荐使用 TGI、SageMaker SDK 和 Python 3.13",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c81da99950830cc",
      "translationZh": "计划和脚本与实际运行的内容一致",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3945b543dd45dc8",
      "translationZh": "区域、角色、环境",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4367f4dc3b22374d",
      "translationZh": "执行，然后验证资源已被移除",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92f42eea983e63b6",
      "translationZh": "表 1：智能体在未安装技能和已安装技能的情况下执行同一请求",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ce7750bacd9e903",
      "translationZh": "本文余下部分将展示我们如何使用智能体技能，在 SageMaker AI 端点上部署 Hugging Face 模型（表 1 的右侧列）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4a676c46111a4761",
      "translationZh": "用于在 SageMaker AI 上部署 Hugging Face 模型的智能体技能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad508460038b7388",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Skills GitHub 仓库中的六项技能涵盖了端到端的部署工作流程。规划器技能负责编排其余五项技能，如下图所示。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d81cf7c9567efd31",
      "translationZh": "智能体技能示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b45ef54a8e7bea9",
      "translationZh": "智能体技能是一种遵循开放标准的软件包，由一个文件夹组成，其中必须包含 SKILL.md 文件。该文件包含元数据（至少包括名称和描述），以及告诉智能体如何执行特定任务的指令。技能通过渐进式披露方式加载。当当前任务与某项技能的描述匹配时，智能体会按需读取该技能。以下是 hf-cloud-serving-image-selection 技能的精简版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "05c01c892f8988c9",
      "translationZh": "端到端模型部署阶段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0edd814cc055d906",
      "translationZh": "这些技能驱动五项 AWS 服务。Amazon SageMaker AI 托管端点，AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM) 提供执行角色。Amazon Elastic Container Registry (Amazon ECR) 和 AWS Deep Learning Containers 提供推理服务镜像，而 Amazon CloudWatch 则支撑告警功能。技能中的所有辅助脚本都通过 Boto3 和 AWS Command Line Interface (AWS CLI) 调用这些服务，从而保留对所创建资源的完全控制。SageMaker Python SDK 也可以使用，但这些技能默认使用 Boto3。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed906d52ff5098df",
      "translationZh": "部署分为六个阶段：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e1f09e08b522603f",
      "translationZh": "通过只读调用探查 AWS 上下文（配置档案、区域、账户和调用者身份）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "440074d1cd342529",
      "translationZh": "使用受支持的 Python 版本和最新的 boto3 设置隔离的 Python 环境。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ad8a52f09d70b723",
      "translationZh": "查找现有的 SageMaker AI 执行角色，仅在不存在该角色且你拥有权限时才创建一个。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c27b644ec41f3a51",
      "translationZh": "选择推理服务容器系列，并从 AWS DLC 目录中解析出当前可用的镜像 URI。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f92aee587e742470",
      "translationZh": "创建模型、端点配置和端点，然后配置自动扩缩容和 Amazon CloudWatch 告警。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6681aeec5acda123",
      "translationZh": "对已上线的端点运行冒烟测试，并报告结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7e5b8641e22dff3b",
      "translationZh": "要跟着操作，你需要具备以下条件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "05da4ee4be0fa620",
      "translationZh": "一个有权使用 Amazon SageMaker AI 的 AWS 账户，包括一个现有的 SageMaker AI 执行角色。这些技能可以自动查找一个执行角色；如果不存在，且你的凭证允许，也可以创建一个。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bae67a0e05e62abe",
      "translationZh": "AWS CLI v2，已配置该账户的凭证。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7de5011e7dbb4ff4",
      "translationZh": "Python 3.10、3.11 或 3.12。不支持 Python 3.13 或更高版本，因为机器学习技术栈中的许多组件尚未发布适用于这些版本的 wheel 包。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d3e636150dec01f4",
      "translationZh": "一个支持技能的编程智能体。本文使用 Kiro IDE。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "eac5cf11fc19565a",
      "translationZh": "Git，用于克隆技能仓库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5cc48a2d697ce985",
      "translationZh": "本文将 Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B 部署到美国东部（弗吉尼亚北部）区域（us-east-1）的单个 ml.g5.xlarge 实时推理实例上。开始之前，请确认您的账户有此实例类型的可用配额。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "57cf50dbadbbf584",
      "translationZh": "请注意，实时端点无论是否处理流量，都会持续计费，因此请在使用完毕后删除端点，或按照本文末尾的清理步骤操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cdf013bd983af172",
      "translationZh": "Kiro 支持两种技能作用域：工作区和全局。工作区技能位于您项目中的 .kiro/skills/ 下，仅适用于特定于该项目的工作流。全局技能位于 ~/.kiro/skills/ 下，可在所有工作区中使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42adae0339424c16",
      "translationZh": "要在当前工作区中安装 Hugging Face Skills GitHub 仓库中的六项技能，请在 Kiro 默认智能体的聊天会话中输入以下请求：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc0272bb754a90a2",
      "translationZh": "Kiro 会汇总已安装的文件，如图 1 所示。请注意，本文测试和使用的是该仓库中具有特定 SHA 的版本：f3186efbbc322121eb5d0f31e8a1d669ee961159。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae3193030649c993",
      "translationZh": "图 1：Kiro 完成六项智能体技能的安装",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "784add403d191280",
      "translationZh": "要确认全部六个技能目录都已存在，请在 Kiro 聊天会话中输入 /，以斜杠命令的形式查看可用技能，如图 2 所示。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e7a166387a78b16",
      "translationZh": "图 2：输入 / 以查看 Kiro 聊天会话中的可用技能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "99e389469fd96efc",
      "translationZh": "使用 Kiro 部署模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d2f226bb130aeda",
      "translationZh": "安装这些技能后，你只需用自然语言向智能体描述模型，规划技能就会接手。你无需指定使用哪种容器系列、如何查找执行角色，或应用哪些生产环境默认配置，因为这些决策都已包含在技能中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46d44964193c4ce5",
      "translationZh": "在 Kiro 聊天会话中输入以下请求：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd853dbc87622444",
      "translationZh": "要部署模型，请完成以下步骤：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40d41845dd55a8de",
      "translationZh": "审核计划。智能体会将部署计划写入文件，并在创建任何计费资源之前等待你的批准。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c8405db07f2937c",
      "translationZh": "发现 AWS 上下文并选择容器。智能体会发现 AWS 上下文（配置文件、区域、账户）。hf-cloud-serving-image-selection 技能会为 Qwen3 选择 vLLM，并从 AWS DLC 目录中解析出镜像 URI。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e489edb27d4db7f",
      "translationZh": "在智能体询问时批准部署。hf-cloud-sagemaker-production-defaults 技能会将模型、端点配置和端点作为一个整体创建，然后配置自动扩缩容和 CloudWatch 告警。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b46b68e7eab6d7e8",
      "translationZh": "验证。在端点达到 InService 状态后，查看智能体报告的冒烟测试结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78c114b7fae5c224",
      "translationZh": "以下几行来自智能体在运行期间记录的部署日志：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e14e7d43c6196d11",
      "translationZh": "对于受访问限制的模型，请添加 HUGGING_FACE_HUB_TOKEN 环境变量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d8e505332e033660",
      "translationZh": "确定执行角色",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f2525dfdae05cf5",
      "translationZh": "在企业账户中，如果 AWS IAM Identity Center 会话没有 IAM 写入权限，调用 iam:CreateRole 就会失败，部署往往因此卡在执行角色这一步。hf-cloud-sagemaker-iam-preflight 技能颠倒了处理顺序：先查找，只有在别无选择时才创建。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c3e982e83711a015",
      "translationZh": "它的 check_role.py 脚本会在账户中搜索与 AmazonSageMaker-ExecutionRole-* 和 *SageMaker*Execution* 等模式匹配的现有角色，并按最后使用日期对它们排序。它还会验证信任策略，并返回 Amazon 资源名称（ARN）。只有在不存在角色且调用者拥有 iam:CreateRole 权限时，它才会创建角色。请注意，创建的角色附带 AmazonSageMakerFullAccess。我们建议遵循最小权限原则，更新该角色，使其仅获得所需的权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bf8fd93bc72a3c8d",
      "translationZh": "应用生产环境默认设置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f5e33c26a7b0f98",
      "translationZh": "hf-cloud-sagemaker-production-defaults 技能将端点从演示用途转变为生产部署。它会将表 2 中的默认设置应用于每个端点，建立运维基线。对于生产部署，你需要添加用户特定的配置，例如 Amazon Virtual Private Cloud 和 AWS Key Management Service 配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c62010f5380f4b85",
      "translationZh": "自动扩缩目标 + 策略",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea5e0d4da7a971c1",
      "translationZh": "endpoint/.../variant/AllTraffic，最小值 1，最大值 4",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "527b52e0db433cf0",
      "translationZh": "表 2：该技能应用于每个端点的生产环境默认设置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f658bd604fdfec0f",
      "translationZh": "编码智能体自主做出的决策",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8d6549d52aeb24d",
      "translationZh": "智能体技能定义了工作流程，但编码智能体仍会在流程内自行做出判断。在一个案例中，当智能体查询 Amazon ECR 以获取最新的镜像标签时，由于 IAM Identity Center 角色缺少 ecr-public:DescribeImages 权限，该调用被拒绝。智能体没有让部署失败，而是回退到该技能随附的、作为兜底措施的已知可用标签，并在日志中记录了原因。在另一个案例中，冒烟测试返回 HTTP 200 后，智能体注意到实际答案始终未被输出。这是因为模型的回复在仍处于 Qwen3 推理块内时，就因达到 max_tokens 而被截断。智能体在日志中将此标记为配置问题：调用方应用程序应提高 token 上限，而不是将这次测试视为通过。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ceeb42208480a69a",
      "translationZh": "实时端点在其存在的整个期间都会对其所用实例计费。请删除你创建的资源，以避免持续产生费用。sagemaker-production-defaults 技能包含一个 teardown.py 脚本，用于移除部署资源，然后确认这些资源已被删除。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4686013e1621b3f6",
      "translationZh": "要清理资源，请完成以下步骤：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c03968b340569dfb",
      "translationZh": "让智能体拆除部署，或直接运行 teardown.py，并提供端点名称和区域。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3576e38448260c21",
      "translationZh": "确认脚本报告端点、端点配置和模型均已删除。该脚本会验证删除结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "433aef0820927c95",
      "translationZh": "检查自动扩缩策略和 CloudWatch 警报是否已移除。删除任何残留项。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ed8ca6907ebe550",
      "translationZh": "六项可复用的智能体技能，将一个缺乏指导的编程智能体转变为能够在 SageMaker AI 端点上部署 Hugging Face 模型、并具备生产就绪功能的智能体。每次部署都包含合适的容器、自动扩缩、CloudWatch 警报，以及经过验证的拆除流程。没有这些技能，智能体会选用过时的容器，跳过生产环境保障措施，并留下具有误导性的文档。本文逐一介绍这些技能：AWS 上下文发现、Python 环境设置、IAM 角色解析、从 AWS DLC 目录中选择容器，以及使用生产环境默认配置进行部署。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2ee8cfe740450e6",
      "translationZh": "要开始使用，请从 Hugging Face Skills GitHub 仓库安装这些技能，并部署你的第一个模型。这些技能是开源的，欢迎贡献。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e12edee37604cacc",
      "translationZh": "团队还可以使用 Amazon SageMaker JumpStart，直接从控制台部署一组热门的 Hugging Face 模型，并使用 Inference Recommendations 自动进行基准测试，为其工作负载选择最佳实例类型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab3fd431eec150de",
      "translationZh": "Amazon SageMaker AI 开发者指南 – 实时推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d19d93805329ac6",
      "translationZh": "AWS Deep Learning Containers 文档",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
